Estimate nutrition for foods described by the user. Return a JSON object matching this structure:
{
  "foods": [
    {
      "food_name": "string",
      "quantity_g": 0,
      "calories_g": 0,
      "protein_g": 0,
      "carbs_g": 0,
      "fat_g": 0
    }
  ],
  "notes": "string"
}
Estimate reasonable portions when quantities are vague. Do not claim estimates are exact. If essential food information is ambiguous, mention
the uncertainty in notes.
